# Handwritten room rule authoring contract. This file is intentionally not generated by SDK-GEN.
#
# The base of room rules written in GDScript (RealtimeRoomV1). Rule scripts are compiled to
# GSL by the GS2 realtime authoring compiler; Godot never runs them. This base, Gs2Record,
# Gs2Step and Gs2Room only give the editor the types to check rule scripts against.
#
# A rule class declares:
#   const STATE := <its state record class>
#   const RESULT := <its result record class>
#   const ERROR := <its error enum>
# and static handler methods start / on_interact / on_timer / on_tick / on_spawned.
class_name Gs2RoomRules
extends RefCounted
